('Parenting-1v0dqhh','','parent_unspecified','toddler_24_36_months','others_said','relative_caregiver_conflict,drop_nap',r"""Also, my mother blames it on her not napping making her act out (which is true, in the beings when she doesn’t nap she is more of a handful). It she thinks the solution is to make her nap anyways.""",'Grandmother who babysits for work disagrees about the nap.'),
